00:06:19.360 --> 00:06:20.530
and I'm successful.

00:06:20.530 --> 00:06:22.999
I think a lot of this comes
down to self awareness.

00:06:22.999 --> 00:06:25.574
I think when you can accept yourself

00:06:25.574 --> 00:06:28.400
