very subtle thing in there

00:06:28.400 --> 00:06:31.820
once you learn that you have
to accept it as a net gain,

00:06:31.820 --> 00:06:34.260
that for every Ben meeting

00:06:34.260 --> 00:06:36.610
that led to amazing things with Pinterest,

00:06:36.610 --> 00:06:39.720
