00:06:39.720 --> 00:06:42.660
or a waste of time or an awkward situation

00:06:42.660 --> 00:06:45.014
or things that you
didn't want to deal with,

00:06:45.014 --> 00:06:48.010
it's a part of the game.
- It is part of the game

00:06:48.010 --> 00:06:50.890
and one of my favorite
words is the world parley,

00:06:50.890 --> 00:06:52.600
just like everything you're doing,

00:06:52.600 --> 00:06:54.950
parleying it or some aspect
