00:08:16.193 --> 00:08:19.040
Anyway, nonetheless, yes Newton, Mass,

00:08:19.040 --> 00:08:20.690
so very nice town.

00:08:20.690 --> 00:08:22.260
Newton always makes me
think of Short Hills

00:08:22.260 --> 00:08:23.170
