00:08:23.170 --> 00:08:24.360
so nice little town.

00:08:24.360 --> 00:08:25.940
- By the way, one of my earliest memories

00:08:25.940 --> 00:08:27.640
is maybe six, seven, eight years old

00:08:27.640 --> 00:08:29.720
I learned that there was colleges

00:08:29.720 --> 00:08:31.270
where you could have two year programs

00:08:31.270 --> 00:08:32.970
and four year programs, Mount Ida,

00:08:32.970 --> 00:08:34.560
and then there were like universities

00:08:34.560 --> 00:08:35.640
where you get graduate degrees

00:08:35.640 --> 00:08:37.130
and I remember learning
that and being like,

00:08:37.130 --> 00:08:38.610
I would never want to go to university,

00:08:38.610 --> 00:08:40.070
