towards the final mile,

00:27:53.980 --> 00:27:54.990
it is really different.

00:27:54.990 --> 00:27:56.070
You need different advisors,

00:27:56.070 --> 00:27:56.990
you need different,

00:27:56.990 --> 00:27:58.010
you need a different playbook

00:27:58.010 --> 00:27:58.860
and that's what it's about.

00:27:58.860 --> 00:28:00.442
- I love that.

